				},
				{
					"id": 721540402,
					"content": "你觉得这部「映影」怎么样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721540403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721540403,
					"content": "大人们认为，这「映影」有助于传扬幕府武士的威名。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721540404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721540404,
					"content": "也许是我在这方面有些愚钝吧…我真的没有这方面的感觉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721540405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721540405,
					"content": "而且，这台本里的武士们尽说些丧气话，全然没有武士的威严。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721540406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721540406,
					"content": "不知道上面的大人们为什么会答应下来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721540407,
					"content": "「御影炉心」还好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721540408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721540408,
					"content": "自从范兵卫大人「升迁」后，现在那边的负责人已经换成了阳介。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721540409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721540409,
					"content": "他是工匠出身，十分踏实可靠，也很会处理实务。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721540410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721540410,
					"content": "「御影炉心」由他负责，应该不会再出什么问题了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				}
